  "title": "WhatsApp Expands Scheduled Message Features Across Chats",
  "summary": "WhatsApp introduces the ability to schedule messages in both group and individual chats, allowing users to send messages up to 14 days in advance. This feature is a significant addition to the platform’s messaging capabilities, catering to users who want to organize their interactions more effectively.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "WhatsApp allows users to schedule messages up to 14 days in advance for both private and group chats.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "This feature is part of WhatsApp’s broader expansion of its messaging capabilities, offering users more control over their communication.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "WhatsApp has been a leader in messaging innovation for several years, and this feature is a continuation of its commitment to enhancing user experience.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
